# Gorilla 157 privacy cut
# Satellite toolbar menu fixes (maintainer screenshot 2026-10-04, build 23): window looked up through ownerDocument.defaultView (Node.ownerGlobal does not exist in this tree, so the menu's opening handler threw and showed every item, and its commands failed); the menu drawn black with the toolbar's cyan text through a scoped !important rule, since the theme forces every menu to the system colours.
